@startuml 订阅标签时序图

actor 用户 as User
participant "订阅页面UI\n(subscription)" as UI
participant "认证工具\n(auth.js)" as Auth
participant "请求工具\n(request.js)" as Request
participant "云函数\n(api)" as Cloud
database "云数据库\n(subscriptions)" as CloudDB

User -> UI: 点击标签或来源
activate UI

alt 未登录
  UI -> Auth: 检查登录状态
  activate Auth
  Auth --> UI: 返回未登录
  deactivate Auth
  
  UI --> User: 显示登录提示
  deactivate UI
  
  User -> UI: 点击登录
  activate UI
  UI --> User: 跳转登录页
  deactivate UI
  
else 已登录
  UI -> UI: 更新本地状态\n(即时反馈)
  
  UI --> User: Toast提示\n切换订阅状态
  
  UI -> Request: callApi('user/subscribe/set',\n{userId, tagIds, sourceIds})
  activate Request
  
  Request -> Cloud: 调用云函数
  activate Cloud
  
  Cloud -> CloudDB: 查询现有订阅\n(userId)
  activate CloudDB
  CloudDB --> Cloud: 返回订阅数据
  deactivate CloudDB
  
  Cloud -> Cloud: 更新tagIds\n和sourceIds
  
  Cloud -> CloudDB: 保存到数据库
  activate CloudDB
  CloudDB --> Cloud: 返回成功
  deactivate CloudDB
  
  Cloud --> Request: 返回{ok: true}
  deactivate Cloud
  
  Request --> UI: 返回成功
  deactivate Request
  
  UI -> UI: 加载相关内容\n(基于tagIds/sourceIds)
  
  UI -> Request: callApi('feed/recommend',\n{tags, sources})
  activate Request
  Request -> Cloud: 查询推荐内容
  activate Cloud
  Cloud --> Request: 返回内容列表
  deactivate Cloud
  Request --> UI: 返回数据
  deactivate Request
  
  UI --> User: 显示推荐内容
  deactivate UI
end

@enduml

